        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI am hesitant about adding an extra configuration in general, yet alone the one that can already be partially configured in a way that I see matters.\r\n\r\nWould you mind elaborating a bit about why do you think this is needed? Is it a personal preference and you want to make delay longer/shorter or is there some technical reason (it conflicts with something, etc.)? ",
