        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "`main` branch now has mentions that those helper messages are purely informational. It is right next to `silent = false` in default config which is present in both module's help and README. Hope this will clarify that there is no need of waiting for the message to press the key.\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nI think I am going to close this for reasons from previous comments.",
