            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> I am strongly against instant feedback. Mostly because it gets annoying pretty quickly at the rate 'mini.ai' and 'mini.surround' keys are expected to be used.\r\n\r\nYes, I agree with this. I have set `silent = true` for these two modules.  \r\n\r\nAs for `mini.align`, I find the help information to be very useful.\r\n\r\nIt would be better if `ga` had quick feedback like `gA`, I think.",
