        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> It would be better if `ga` had quick feedback like `gA`, I think.\r\n\r\n`ga` is intended for a quick `gaip=` / `gaip<Space>`, so showing the message immediately also feels distracting. For a more complex aligning I suggest using `gA` which is intended to be more interactive.",
